0505e014000ab3079967b4f6b3d2caf5.png 1. Multiplayer now runs on Steam lobbies Create and join rooms through Steam: create a room in the multiplayer lobby and other players join straight from the room list, with no extra servers or setup. Friend invites: invite Steam friends from the in-game pause menu (\"Invite Friends\"); a friend who accepts joins your room directly. The host is a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:09:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943434","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075190-1844115010500391","game_id":"steam-5075190","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Live! Play Vangrid for Free","summary":"Great news! Vangrid's free demo is now officially live — anyone can download and play right away, no application or invite needed.The demo includes:・The full tutorial level・Our two signature modes: Conquest and DefendBase・Solo play or co-op with friends (up to 15 waves)・The current build's weapons, vehicles, and backpack active-skill systemEnjoying it? Add Vangrid to your wishlist to get notified the moment we launch! We'd also love to hear your feedback in the comments.We'll also be at Steam Ne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T05:43:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075190-1843481262700573","game_id":"steam-5075190","kind":"update","title":"v0.0.3+4 Update: 12 Weapons + Steam Achievements/Stats/Leaderboards","summary":"New FeaturesWeapon roster expanded: 6 -> 12 weapons, adding shotgun (cone-shaped AoE damage), flamethrower (burning zone), sniper rifle, SMG, grenade launcher, and homing missileFull Steam achievements/stats/leaderboards system is liveAdded ESC quick-close for panels (inventory / pause menu / all 8 interactive shops)Warehouse category tabs now support mouse clicks and Q/E hotkeysAdded bomber bombing sound effectsFixes & ImprovementsWidened the area of explosion ground scorch decalsPolished bombe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075190-1842846814452028","game_id":"steam-5075190","kind":"update","title":"v0.0.3 Update: Hero Hiring, City Terrain, Netcode Fixes","summary":"New FeaturesHero Hiring System: hire dedicated hero units (Assault or Medic archetype) with faster movement speed; they patrol near their post instead of standing completely idleCity terrain expanded to Conquest and Defend Base: new sidewalk terrain, city block chunk variants, buildings aligned to sidewalksAdded Russian, German, and Turkish localizationFixesFixed an occasional Forge2D physics engine crash during multiplayer sessionsFixed multiplayer sync issues with the supply chain and supply c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T02:41:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5075190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5075190":"2026-10-26T08:00:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5075190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"